Cell["\<\
Remarkably, Faraday\[CloseCurlyQuote]s apparatus is pretty much the same as \
the one Mims had you build to illustrate the effect of a transformer, and you \
are not far from understanding it. Here is the apparatus:\
\>", "Text",
